== The Reverse-Hanger Test

Turn every hanger so the hook faces the wrong way. When you wear a piece and wash it, hang it back the right way. After a month or two, look at what is still backward. Write it here and decide.

#v(0.15in)
#_wk-table(
  (1fr, 3.6em, 3.6em, 3.6em, 3.6em),
  ([Still backward after #_wk-blank(0.4in) weeks], [Keep], [Donate], [Sell], [Toss]),
  (
    [Shirts and tops],
    [Pants and skirts],
    [Dresses],
    [Jackets and coats],
    [Sweaters],
    [Shoes (not worn since #_wk-blank(0.4in))],
    [Accessories],
    [Something I kept "just in case"],
  ),
  extra: 4, y: 10.5pt,
)

